# Second corpus (mini social network). The agent generated a whole runnable
# project, so these folders carry a toolchain as well as the code under study.
# Version the SOURCE — it is the experimental artefact — and never the rest:
# node_modules alone is 232 MB per copy, and the database is run state, not code.
manual-corpus*/node_modules/
manual-corpus*/dist/
manual-corpus*/*.sqlite
manual-run*/node_modules/
manual-run*/dist/
manual-run*/*.sqlite
